  "scope": "Packaged Linux ARM64 and x64 OCI Rust images with the local Node reference on macOS ARM64. Linux x64 used Rosetta. Real HTTP account and protection cases ran in isolated PGlite, bundled PostgreSQL and external PostgreSQL. The shared external PostgreSQL handoff ran Node to Rust to Node with retained wrappers and browser cryptography.",
